<?xml version="1.0"?>
<Container version="2">
  <Name>Belot</Name>
  <Icon>https://github.com/leppermesiah/belot/blob/main/icon.png</Icon>
  <Repository>leppermesiah/belot:latest</Repository>
  <Registry>https://hub.docker.com/r/leppermesiah/belot</Registry>
  <Network>bridge</Network>
  <MyIP/>
  <Shell>sh</Shell>
  <Privileged>false</Privileged>
  <Support>https://github.com/leppermesiah/belot/issues</Support>
  <Project>https://github.com/leppermesiah/belot</Project>
  <Overview>Самостоятелен, self-hosted белот за 4 играчи - играе се направо в браузъра. Пълни официални правила, двуезичен интерфейс (BG/EN), drag-and-drop карти, именуване на отборите, recap на всяка ръка.</Overview>
  <Category>GameServers</Category>
  <WebUI>http://[IP]:[PORT:8080]/</WebUI>
  <TemplateURL>https://raw.githubusercontent.com/leppermesiah/belot/main/templates/belot.xml</TemplateURL>
  <Config Name="WebUI Port" Target="8080" Default="8080" Mode="tcp" Description="WebUI Port" Type="Port" Display="always" Required="true" Mask="false">8080</Config>
</Container>
